cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this repository in academic work, please cite it as below."
title: "vlm-dflash: a unified training and evaluation stack for multimodal parallel drafters"
type: software
license: Apache-2.0
version: 0.3.0
date-released: 2026-10-12
abstract: >-
  A training, evaluation and export stack for multimodal speculative drafters
  (DFlash, DSpark, Domino, JetSpec, DFlash2) on Qwen2.5-VL and Qwen3-VL
  targets, with staged hidden-state capture, runtime model contracts,
  provenance gates and a token-exact acceptance gate.
keywords:
  - speculative decoding
  - vision-language models
  - multimodal
  - drafter training
  - Qwen-VL
authors:
  - name: "vlm-dflash contributors"
